Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:20.93,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}夢想過平靜的安穩生活
