Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:28.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們走慣的道路到底在何方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:31.44,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}偶爾因世態炎涼惱火
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:33.87,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}只是身在福中不知福
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:36.04,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}火光亮起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:38.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}指引方向
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:44.25,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}回憶中響起了溫柔旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:50.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
